### Health Check
GET https://70c3aab4-a0e6-4543-a7b3-b85d4f7e3c7c.tunnel4.com/health

### Discovery
GET https://70c3aab4-a0e6-4543-a7b3-b85d4f7e3c7c.tunnel4.com/api/discovery

### Register User
POST https://70c3aab4-a0e6-4543-a7b3-b85d4f7e3c7c.tunnel4.com/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "course": "1",
  "role": "student"
}

### Login
POST https://70c3aab4-a0e6-4543-a7b3-b85d4f7e3c7c.tunnel4.com/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get Current User
GET https://70c3aab4-a0e6-4543-a7b3-b85d4f7e3c7c.tunnel4.com/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Validate Token
POST https://70c3aab4-a0e6-4543-a7b3-b85d4f7e3c7c.tunnel4.com/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### GitHub Auth Init
POST https://70c3aab4-a0e6-4543-a7b3-b85d4f7e3c7c.tunnel4.com/api/auth/init

### Check Auth Status
GET https://70c3aab4-a0e6-4543-a7b3-b85d4f7e3c7c.tunnel4.com/api/auth/status?token=YOUR_LOGIN_TOKEN

### List Users (Admin only)
GET https://70c3aab4-a0e6-4543-a7b3-b85d4f7e3c7c.tunnel4.com/api/users/list
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN